Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): Ecom Ops Manager
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2294_Flow8</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2294_Flow9</bpmn:outgoing>
