        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-410 (TP arm&#x27;s-length — links to VS-72 / W235); CTL-44 (entity-attribution integrity); operational: Finance Manager monthly reconciliation sign-off
Owner: Finance Manager</bpmn:text>
